WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:00.734
I’m Kevin Hart.

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.935
And I’m Kenan Thompson.

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.103
And we’re here together again

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.170
for another edition of

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.338
Back That Year Up!

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.506
A wild look back at all the 

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.574
crazy, funny, weird things

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.875
that happened in 2023.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.043
Yeah, we even convinced some of our

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.579
celebrity friends to come and join us, like

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:13.279
Simone Biles,

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.314
Kelly Clarkson,

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:15.315
Jay Pharoah,

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:16.416
David Alan Grier.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.217
Now, wait a minute, though.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:17.751
This is all your people.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:18.518
Where are my friends?

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.153
Bet you ask yourself that a lot.

